  * Glass command card (TsGlassPanel) hosted in a chrome-less Button = the click target -> DialogRequested
    (web onRequestDialog(def)); suppressed while a dispatch is in flight (web `loading`).
  * Favorite-toggle star (TsButton, Icon variant) -> FavoriteToggled (web onToggleFavorite); always reachable
    for keyboard/Narrator (the web hides it behind opacity-0 group-hover, which is not accessible).
  * Variant -> hover/focus border accent (web hoverStyles: default->cyan, danger->red, success->green).
  * Icon badge with the command glyph, swapped for a TsSpinner busy ring while in flight (web Loader2).
  * Label (web t(def.labelKey,...)), optional sublabel (web t(def.sublabelKey,...)), optional last-command
    status caption with the web tone rule (U+2713 prefix -> success/green, any other non-blank -> failure/red).
  * Every string via the i18n facade; static key commands.toggleFavorite present in P1/S10 catalog
    (apps/shared/i18n/catalog/en.json -> translation.commands.toggleFavorite = "Toggle favorite").
  * PII-safe diagnostics: view.opened / dialog.requested / favorite.toggled, slug=InputCommandTile.
  * No fetch-driven empty/error/stale/offline branch: the web source's only data source is useTranslation
    (documented in the Model, matching the sibling ToolCard / HighlightCard / AddWidgetButton presentational ports).
  * Reduced-motion honoured by construction (no bespoke looping motion; the busy ring is the system progress indicator).
  * All UI-free logic (branch/tone/accent/automation-name/i18n) in InputCommandTileProjection -> unit-tested headlessly.

